\subtree{
  \title{Diagrams in Forester!}

  \p{Shortly after adding the ability to [embed lilypond snippets](00IO) in my forest, I [finished adding support](00H5) for embedded [diagrams](https://diagrams.github.io/) code as well:

\diagram{200}{*}{\verb<<<|
dia = hcat [circle 1 # fc red, circle 1 # fc green, circle 1 # fc blue] # lw thick # frame 0.3
<<<}
  }

  \p{I'm super excited that I finally got this to work.  I've already used it to add some diagrams to my [Discrete math lecture notes](0021), for example, [here](00I3).  If you're curious to see how this works, check out the [Shake file here](https://github.com/byorgey/forest/blob/main/Shake.hs).}
}

